# OnlyDOMs Windsurf Rules & Auto-Initialization

When asked to initialize, set up, or run this repository:

1. Run `./setup.sh --install` (or `setup.bat --install` on Windows) to compile the release binary and automatically configure available MCP clients.
2. The MCP server binary is located at `mcp-server/target/release/onlydoms`.
3. To configure OnlyDOMs in Windsurf manually (if not auto-registered via `./setup.sh --install`), add to `~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json`:
   ```json
   {
     "mcpServers": {
       "onlydoms": {
         "command": "<absolute-path-to-repo>/mcp-server/target/release/onlydoms",
         "args": ["--port", "9222"]
       }
     }
   }
   ```
4. Instruct the user to load the unpacked extension from `<absolute-path-to-repo>/extension` at `chrome://extensions/`.
5. When automating browser tasks, always prioritize `execute_browser_pipeline` to batch multi-step actions into a single compound turn.
